1
00:00:00,566 --> 00:00:08,973
Welcome to HTL Content Guard PC, the content blocker that helps you stay focused and protected on your Windows computer.

2
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:22,285
In this video, I'll show you every step: how to download and install it, set it up in one minute, block websites, apps and keywords, and how the free trial and Premium work.

3
00:00:23,604 --> 00:00:27,797
First, open our website and click Download free for Windows.

4
00:00:27,959 --> 00:00:32,771
It's a single file of about two and a half megabytes, so there's nothing to unzip.

5
00:00:34,047 --> 00:00:37,493
Every feature is free for four days.

6
00:00:37,655 --> 00:00:41,191
You don't need a card, a payment, or even an account to start.

7
00:00:42,476 --> 00:00:43,989
Open the downloaded file.

8
00:00:44,151 --> 00:00:50,213
Because we're a new publisher, Windows may show a blue box called Windows protected your PC.

9
00:00:50,389 --> 00:00:52,198
This is normal for new apps.

10
00:00:52,373 --> 00:00:53,358
Click More info.

11
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,192
Then click Run anyway.

12
00:00:57,549 --> 00:01:01,639
Windows now asks if this app may make changes to your device.

13
00:01:01,815 --> 00:01:02,696
Click Yes.

14
00:01:02,846 --> 00:01:07,786
The app needs this permission to block websites for every browser on your computer.

15
00:01:09,063 --> 00:01:10,756
The setup window opens.

16
00:01:10,932 --> 00:01:11,865
Click Next.

17
00:01:13,137 --> 00:01:16,055
Keep the suggested folder, and click Install.

18
00:01:17,331 --> 00:01:19,991
Installation takes just a few seconds.

19
00:01:21,248 --> 00:01:26,124
Leave Open HTL Content Guard PC now ticked, and click Finish.

20
00:01:26,287 --> 00:01:28,740
You can always open the app again from the Start menu.

21
00:01:30,015 --> 00:01:32,211
The app opens with a one-minute setup.

22
00:01:32,373 --> 00:01:33,577
Choose your language.

23
00:01:33,752 --> 00:01:39,982
The app speaks English, Bengali, Arabic, Urdu, Indonesian and Turkish.

24
00:01:41,278 --> 00:01:42,378
Then write your goal.

25
00:01:42,541 --> 00:01:45,329
It's shown on the block page to remind you why you started.

26
00:01:45,492 --> 00:01:46,464
Click Next.

27
00:01:47,726 --> 00:01:49,200
Now pick what you want to block.

28
00:01:49,363 --> 00:01:52,989
Adult content and gambling are blocked around the clock.

29
00:01:53,164 --> 00:01:57,190
Short videos, like Shorts and Reels, are selected too.

30
00:01:58,485 --> 00:02:01,145
Tap any other list you want, like Social media.

31
00:02:01,307 --> 00:02:03,310
You can change all of this later.

32
00:02:03,472 --> 00:02:04,367
Click Next.

33
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:08,843
Finally, choose how strict to be with yourself.

34
00:02:09,019 --> 00:02:11,498
Off lets you change anything at any time.

35
00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:18,470
Mindful, which we recommend, asks you to type a long text and wait one minute before you can lower protection.

36
00:02:18,645 --> 00:02:22,039
Committed makes you wait a full day, or longer if you choose.

37
00:02:23,352 --> 00:02:31,050
For your first seven days, practice mode keeps every lock to two hours at most, so you can't trap yourself by mistake.

38
00:02:31,213 --> 00:02:32,262
Click Finish.

39
00:02:33,531 --> 00:02:34,168
That's it.

40
00:02:34,343 --> 00:02:39,425
Your protection is already on, and the home screen shows what's being blocked right now.

41
00:02:40,725 --> 00:02:43,849
Websites are already blocked in every browser.

42
00:02:44,011 --> 00:02:52,869
The free browser extension adds even more: it hides Shorts and Reels, blocks pages by keyword, and shows a friendly block page.

43
00:02:53,032 --> 00:03:01,220
Setup has already turned on Install the extension permanently, so the extension adds itself to Chrome, Brave and Vivaldi.

44
00:03:02,498 --> 00:03:09,578
In Microsoft Edge, open the Chrome Web Store, search for HTL Content Guard PC, and click Add to Chrome.

45
00:03:09,753 --> 00:03:13,251
If Edge asks, allow extensions from other stores.

46
00:03:14,566 --> 00:03:19,223
When the extension is connected, the yellow warning on the home screen disappears.

47
00:03:20,499 --> 00:03:21,754
Open Block lists.

48
00:03:21,917 --> 00:03:25,672
A list holds the websites, apps and words you want to block.

49
00:03:25,847 --> 00:03:29,654
Use Add a ready-made list for categories we keep up to date for you.

50
00:03:30,957 --> 00:03:39,931
Social media, video streaming, games, chat apps, news, shopping, dating apps, and even AI homework helpers.

51
00:03:41,223 --> 00:03:43,367
Or click New list to make your own.

52
00:03:43,543 --> 00:03:49,514
Give it a name, then add websites, one per line, programs, like a game, and words.

53
00:03:49,664 --> 00:03:53,896
Any page whose address contains one of these words is blocked.

54
00:03:54,058 --> 00:03:54,978
Click Save.

55
00:03:56,252 --> 00:03:59,621
Lists marked Always on are blocked twenty-four seven.

56
00:03:59,796 --> 00:04:05,471
The others are blocked when you start a focus session, or by a schedule or a daily limit.

57
00:04:06,747 --> 00:04:08,479
To focus right now, go to Home.

58
00:04:08,654 --> 00:04:13,415
Pick the lists to block, choose how long, and how the session can be stopped.

59
00:04:13,590 --> 00:04:16,198
The summary tells you exactly what will happen.

60
00:04:16,373 --> 00:04:17,203
Click Start.

61
00:04:18,490 --> 00:04:22,400
Blocking now shows each list and exactly when it ends.

62
00:04:23,679 --> 00:04:29,432
If you open a blocked site, you'll see this page instead, with your goal, to keep you on track.

63
00:04:30,729 --> 00:04:35,361
Schedules block a list automatically on the days and hours you choose.

64
00:04:35,536 --> 00:04:41,482
Start from a quick template, like Work hours, pick the days, and set the start and end time.

65
00:04:41,657 --> 00:04:42,538
Click Save.

66
00:04:43,827 --> 00:04:45,778
Your week is shown at a glance.

67
00:04:47,061 --> 00:04:50,314
Daily limits give you a set amount of time each day.

68
00:04:50,528 --> 00:04:53,664
For example, thirty minutes of short videos.

69
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:57,363
When the time is used up, it's blocked until tomorrow.

70
00:04:57,538 --> 00:04:58,432
Click Save.

71
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:08,188
In Settings, Force SafeSearch keeps Google, Bing, YouTube and DuckDuckGo in safe mode in every browser.

72
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:12,840
You can also turn off private windows, the most common way around a filter.

73
00:05:14,121 --> 00:05:18,765
With Partial blocking, a site stays useful without the endless scroll.

74
00:05:18,941 --> 00:05:26,033
Hide YouTube Shorts, the home feed, or comments, the Facebook feed and Reels, Instagram Reels, and more.

75
00:05:26,209 --> 00:05:27,644
Remember to click Save.

76
00:05:28,936 --> 00:05:34,405
The Protection page stops you from deleting the app or loosening blocks in a weak moment.

77
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,977
You can switch levels here.

78
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:38,529
Making things stricter works at once.

79
00:05:38,678 --> 00:05:42,150
Making them easier always needs the waiting time you chose.

80
00:05:43,437 --> 00:05:46,355
To uninstall, click Request uninstall.

81
00:05:46,517 --> 00:05:51,071
When your level's rule is met, Windows lets you remove the app as usual.

82
00:05:51,234 --> 00:05:55,659
Every level keeps a safe way out, so nobody is ever locked in.

83
00:05:56,943 --> 00:06:00,544
The top of the app shows how many days of your free trial are left.

84
00:06:00,706 --> 00:06:04,358
When the trial ends, every block you set keeps working.

85
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:08,108
You only need Premium to add new blocks or make them stronger.

86
00:06:09,393 --> 00:06:12,800
To buy, open the Premium page and choose a plan.

87
00:06:14,067 --> 00:06:15,992
Choose bKash or Nagad.

88
00:06:16,168 --> 00:06:20,412
In your payment app, use Send Money to send the amount shown to this number.

89
00:06:20,575 --> 00:06:22,513
You can copy it with one click.

90
00:06:23,792 --> 00:06:28,063
After paying, you'll get a TrxID in the payment message.

91
00:06:28,238 --> 00:06:31,916
Type it here, add your mobile number if you like, and click Submit.

92
00:06:33,194 --> 00:06:38,599
Once we confirm your payment, usually within a few hours, Premium turns on by itself.

93
00:06:38,761 --> 00:06:40,016
There's nothing else to do.

94
00:06:40,192 --> 00:06:43,689
And every purchase has a fourteen-day money-back guarantee.

95
00:06:44,972 --> 00:06:45,686
Need help?

96
00:06:45,836 --> 00:06:51,305
Copy your Device ID from the bottom of the Premium page and send it to us on WhatsApp or by email.

97
00:06:51,467 --> 00:06:52,555
We're happy to help.

98
00:06:53,848 --> 00:06:54,884
Thank you for watching.

99
00:06:55,046 --> 00:06:57,448
Stay focused, and stay protected.
